#source code 
source code is also known as computer code which is set of instruction written in some 
programming language 

#Machine code 
Machine code also known as binary code or an object code which is easily understandable by machine 
which is in form of 0 and 1
machine code also express in hex format 

#Byte code 
byte code is an intermediate code between source code and machine code which is easily 
understandable by virtual machine that software programs 
that emulates the hypothetical cpu it is also known as p code or portable code  


